# Decap CMS — agent-maintained content

The user expects the agent to **update site content** on request. Edit Markdown/YAML under
`src/content/` and media under `public/uploads/` — the same files Decap CMS manages at `/admin/`.

## Collections (CMS → path)

| CMS section | Content path |
| --- | --- |
| Website-Texte | `src/content/site/de/index.md` |
| Über mich | `src/content/about/de/index.md` |
| Bereiche | `src/content/offerings/de/*.md` (Cue Pilot, Sportlehrer, Aufgussmeister, …) |
| Kontakt | `src/content/contact/de/index.md` |
| Rechtliches | `src/content/legal/de/*.md` |

Each offering entry becomes a public page at `/<slug>/` (e.g. `/cue-pilot/`).

Field names must match `src/content.config.ts` and `public/admin/config.yml` — see
`tests/unit/cms-config-parity.test.ts`.

Commit and push to `main` when the user wants changes live.
